# NASA-9 polynomial thermodynamic data for 11-species air,
# extracted from the NASA Glenn CEA thermo.inp database (McBride, Zehe,
# Gordon, NASA/TP-2002-211556).  For use with:
#   react_modify keq_thermo air.nasa9
# which pins every derived reverse reaction's thermal average to the
# CEA equilibrium constant via the energy-resolved residual mechanism.
#
# format per species:  ID nranges
#   then per range:    Tlo Thi
#                      a1 a2 a3 a4 a5
#                      a6 a7 b1 b2
# H/RT = -a1/T^2 + a2 lnT/T + a3 + a4 T/2 + a5 T^2/3 + a6 T^3/4
#        + a7 T^4/5 + b1/T
# S/R  = -a1/(2T^2) - a2/T + a3 lnT + a4 T + a5 T^2/2 + a6 T^3/3
#        + a7 T^4/4 + b2
# electron species ID in SPARTA air files is 'e'

